  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_001 (multimodal, multiprofile, pca_n2000, imagenet_vit_l, avgpool, concat) achieves 0.6287 validation accuracy. This experiment tests replacing the image encoder with resnet50 while keeping other components identical, isolating the impact of image encoder choice. This clarifies whether the complex Vision Transformer (ViT) or the simpler ResNet-50 yields better performance, a critical design decision with high uncertainty. It balances exploration (testing a new image encoder) and exploitation (building on the multimodal/multiprofile baseline)."
